# Theme updates

## Source versions

- New theme drops go in `themes/` (e.g. `themes/trafigura-vX/`).
- When asked to update from a version there, merge/adapt into the live theme root (not leave the site running from `themes/`).
- Preserve local customizations (e.g. SEO folder, this rules folder, intentional query/order fixes) unless the user says otherwise.

## News & partner stories order (required)

Whenever the theme is updated or query templates are regenerated/replaced, **news** and **partner-stories** listings must sort **newest → oldest**.

In `template-parts/query/`:

- All `news-*.php` queries: `"order" => "DESC"`
- All `partner-stories-*.php` queries: `"order" => "DESC"`

Do **not** leave Webflow/Udesly defaults of `"order" => "ASC"`.

```php
// ❌ BAD — oldest first
"order" => "ASC",

// ✅ GOOD — newest first
"order" => "DESC",
```

After any theme sync from `themes/`, re-check these files and fix ASC → DESC if the import reset them.
